 Ultimate communities; platforms like SimTelemetry.site, YouTube channels, competitive leagues.\",\n198\t  \"problem\": [\n199\t    \"Sim racers want to share lap achievements - sector times, deltas vs PB, apex speeds - as shareable cards. SimTelemetry.site records telemetry at 60Hz. Drivers currently screenshot lap times or manually create graphics; a deterministic lap card lets them share standardized achievements.\"\n200\t  ],\n201\t  \"sources\": [\n202\t    \"https://simtelemetry.site\",\n203\t    \"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49045861\"\n204\t  ],\n205\t  \"solution\": [\n206\t    \"A deterministic lap card: each sector shows its time and delta (negative = faster, positive = slower) with a proportional bar that is green when faster or red when slower than PB. Driver name and top speed complete the context. The delta bar makes it obvious at a glance which sector was the bottleneck on this run.\"\n207\t  ],\n208\t  \"usage\": {\n209\t    \"command\": \"m0saic make @one-a-day/sports/lap-telemetry-card/v1 --template-repo . -w 1280 -h 720 -o lap.png\",\n210\t    \"try\": [\n211\t      \"Add --topSpeed 310 to show higher speeds\",\n212\t      \"Try portrait: -w 1080 -h 1920\",\n213\t      \"Square crop: -w 1080 -h 1080\"\n214\t    ]\n215\t  },\n216\t  \"timeline\": {\n217\t    \"source\": \"runner\",\n218\t    \"phases\": [\n219\t      {\n220\t        \"name\": \"scout\",\n221\t        \"startMs\": 0,\n222\t        \"durMs\": 217259,\n223\t        \"calls\": 100,\n224\t        \"tokens\": 8356979,\n225\t        \"costUsd\": 0.44,\n226\t        \"tools\": \"Bash 93, Read 4, Write 2\"\n227\t      },\n228\t      {\n229\t        \"name\": \"plan\",\n230\t        \"startMs\": 217273,\n231\t        \"durMs\": 63094,\n232\t        \"calls\": 11,\n233\t        \"tokens\": 923341,\n234\t        \"costUsd\": 0.11,\n235\t        \"tools\": \"Read 7, Glob 2, Bash 1\"\n236\t      }\n237\t    ],\n238\t    \"costBasis\": \"reported\"\n239\t  }\n240\t};\n241\t\n242\texport